WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:04.421
Welcome to the famous - and infamous -

00:00:04.505 --> 00:00:07.007
Las Colinas Resort.

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:11.553
Acapulco in 1980 was the best place to be.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:13.597
Everyone from Hollywood was there,

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:16.683
and the parties were insane.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:19.269
The aesthetic was really unique
and wonderful. 

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.772
You guys know the word "bodacious"?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:25.817
The hotel is a complete extension
of Acapulco.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:28.862
We needed something
with a lot of personality

00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:32.324
that screams and shouts
"Mexico" in every shot.

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:33.992
Here we are in the lobby.

00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:36.912
Most of what you're going to see
wasn't here.

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.874
The lattice work was created,
inspired by lattice work from Acapulco.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.167
Those arches weren't there.

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:43.585
Of course, the color wasn't here.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:47.339
When I got here, it was kind of like
a beigey brown color.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:51.134
And within a day,
they had painted the entire hotel pink.

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:53.178
It definitely brought it more to life.

00:00:53.262 --> 00:00:55.556
It just gave it a...
like a positive energy.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.851
We went a little crazy,
and we said, like... "why not?"

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:03.397
It's very flashy, it's very vibrant,
very... 80s.

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:10.863
I hope coming to visit Las Colinas
will always be "in fashion."

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:12.531
See what I did there?

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:15.909
Yes, I'd want to go back to the 80s.
Are you crazy?

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.828
Who wouldn't want to go back to the 80s?

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:21.832
I love the 80s. I love the fashion
that happened in that time.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:26.003
I like the fun about the 80s.

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:29.089
When you're wearing 80s clothes,
it just makes you feel...

00:01:29.173 --> 00:01:30.090
I don't know, more badass.

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:34.511
It's a collaboration, with wardrobe,
with hair and make-up.

00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:36.555
We have an amazing team.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.726
All the art, all the lamps
and every detail that you can see,

00:01:40.976 --> 00:01:44.229
was designed and custom-made
for the show.

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:50.152
Even though it's a comedy,
even though it's so bold and so colorful,

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:52.863
it's a very authentic and fun story.

00:01:53.071 --> 00:01:56.491
The vibe, the food, the colors,
the people...

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:57.784
This is the real Mexico.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:01:59.870
Acapulco is the real Mexico.

